{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story-driven psychological horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brother Jim has missed his  communal work shift due to relapsing. You have no choice but to help him avoid imprisonment, as this is his last chance before guaranteed prison time. He's audibly mortified - you've got to take care of this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only help Jim by completing his shift right away. By doing so, you end up at the mercy of whatever has started <i>haunting</i> you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Incomprehensible events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to keep your mind sharp - things might not be what they seem to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924080/extras/b040e47122fc84ea0d874a752b5f3fd6.poster.avif?t=1773839988\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924080/extras/b040e47122fc84ea0d874a752b5f3fd6.webm?t=1773839988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sanity hanging by a thread</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start\u00a0<i>enjoying</i> the tormenting reality<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924080/extras/667a02a2426cffa7184fd56560dea532.poster.avif?t=1773839988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924080/extras/667a02a2426cffa7184fd56560dea532.webm?t=1773839988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924080/extras/667a02a2426cffa7184fd56560dea532.mp4?t=1773839988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >N